      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve traveled through many regions, and I can tell\nyou—Lumiose’s skyline is special. Really brings<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhome how tall some of buildings are, you know?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
