      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E006500200077006800650072006500200077006500200062006F0074006800200075007300650020006F006E006C007900200046006C00790069006E0067002D0074007900700065000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You can have as many Pokémon on your team as\nyou like, as long as they all share the Flying type.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nHow about it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
